usage: download.py [-h] [--data-root DATA_ROOT]
                   [--source {qm9,pdbbind,ani2x,spice2,transition1x,pdb_apo,misato}]
                   [--all] [--check] [--misato-md] [--pdb-list PDB_LIST]

Download and manage dtMol project datasets.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --data-root DATA_ROOT
                        Root directory for all datasets (default:
                        /data/dtMol_Project/datasets)
  --source {qm9,pdbbind,ani2x,spice2,transition1x,pdb_apo,misato}
                        Download a single dataset by name
  --all                 Download all auto-downloadable datasets
  --check               Scan data-root and print FOUND/MISSING status for all
                        datasets
  --misato-md           Include MISATO MD trajectory (~133GB) — requires
                        confirmation
  --pdb-list PDB_LIST   File with PDB IDs for apo download (one per line),
                        overrides built-in list

Examples:
  python -m dtmol.data.download --check
  python -m dtmol.data.download --source ani2x
  python -m dtmol.data.download --all
  python -m dtmol.data.download --all --misato-md
